.TH CRUNCH_CREATE_MODULE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_create_module \- invokes obsolete create_module syscall 174, unimplemented on linux x86-64 and returning enosys
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/module.h>
.B long crunch_create_module(const char* name, size_t size);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes obsolete create_module syscall 174, unimplemented on Linux x86-64 and returning ENOSYS.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR create_module (2)
